From 6f2263223784bbd43c4cfe299b6a50ad9ade70bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:31:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XFA: Lay out tables

Tables (layout="table") were stacked as one column, which made the
tables of most immigration and many tax forms unusable. Rows now place
their cells side by side in the columns given by columnWidths, cells
span columns with colSpan, and the cells of a row take the height of
the highest one. Columns without a width are as wide as their widest
cell. Rows outside tables lay out side by side with natural widths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
